body:json {
  {
    "name":"Anime",
    "styleSystemPrompt":"Vivid and saturated colors, multi-layered colorful shading, high contrast between warm highlights and cool shadows., Dramatic framing, dynamic low-angle perspective, shallow depth of field focusing on the character's face., Fine hair strands, crisp line weight variation, sparkling eye highlights, and clean digital gradients., Dynamic lighting, high-contrast rim light, colorful ambient bounce, and dramatic shadow placement to define form., Energetic, dramatic, and intensely emotional with an upbeat yet cinematic atmosphere., A vibrant, stylized background with floating particles and energetic light trails, suggesting a high-action urban or fantasy setting., High-quality cel-shaded illustration, clean sharp lineart, vibrant modern anime aesthetic, professional key visual style., An anime protagonist with large expressive eyes featuring complex iris patterns and voluminous, intricately detailed hair."
  }
}

